{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10295010","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10295010","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1029501001:1":{"text":"You came from over there; does that mean... You really went to the Moon Temple to hear the divine revelation?","source_cn":"你们从那个方向过来，难道说……你们真的去月神遗殿聆听神...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB74FA233EA73279","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029501002:1":{"text":"Of course! I lent the moonstone to the magister to throw into the Moon Temple spring.","source_cn":"当然！我把月光石借给老师，投入月神殿的泉眼内了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3DD524066E248CBC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Of course! I lent the moonstone to the magister to throw into the Moon Temple spring.","female":"Of course! I lent the moonstone to the magister to throw into the Moon Temple spring.","variant_male_record_index":"115425","variant_female_record_index":"115426","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029501003:1":{"text":"You're too reckless! I haven't even finished researching this legend...","source_cn":"你也太莽撞了，我还没有做完这个传说的考证……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46EAA7200264528D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029501004:1":{"text":"Of course I was going to try if I got the chance!","source_cn":"难得有机会当然要试验一下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDABE7936A3216036","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1029501004":{"text":"Of course I was going to try if I got the chance!","source_cn":"难得有机会当然要试验一下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDABE7936A3216036","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029501005:1":{"text":"Ah, that's a relief. As long as nothing strange happened...","source_cn":"那我就放心了，没有发生奇怪的事情就好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD7BC59C2D2266CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029501006:1":{"text":"Well... Now that you mention it...","source_cn":"呃……奇怪的事倒也……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEA23F4DA96D5FBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029501007:1":{"text":"Eh? What? You don't mean...","source_cn":"嗯？怎么了，难道……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69FDB2CC910A0F77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1029501008:1":{"text":"We didn't exactly succeed in gaining Nakalig's revelation...","source_cn":"某种程度上来说，并没有成功获得月神的启示——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6CEA1E06004099E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1029501009:1":{"text":"As expected...","source_cn":"唉，果然如此……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0DD2EE60D95D086","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1029501010:0":{"text":"But we did meet the Celestial, Dionel.","source_cn":"但我们见到了半神萨基塔里斯大人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5618E26F27B17C0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1029501011:1":{"text":"What?! That amazing Celestial? There must be so many academic questions one could consult him about!","source_cn":"什么？！那可是半神大人！一定有很多学术问题可以向他求证。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x719A41D5237B8B6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1029501012:1":{"text":"What was his magic like? What was HE like? Did he carry a spear?","source_cn":"半神大人的魔力是怎样的！半神大人样貌呢？他有手握长矛吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6739857EE6B03478","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1029501013:1":{"text":"It's said that he's already lived for centuries. I'd love to see him with my own eyes...","source_cn":"据说他已经度过了几百年岁月，我也好想亲眼见证他的身姿啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78A4D185CE9297FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1029501014:1":{"text":"However, if this legend has some basis in reality, then another may be feasible too.","source_cn":"不过，如果这个传说是有一定现实依据的话，另一个传说也有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3C32BAB60E4FAD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1029501015:1":{"text":"Are you interested?","source_cn":"你们有兴趣吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53B54B3076DEF750","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:21:1029501015":{"text":"Are you interested?","source_cn":"你们有兴趣吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53B54B3076DEF750","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1029501016:1":{"text":"The second legend says that there are TWO springs hidden in the Moon Temple. The treasure of Nakalig awaits whoever can activate them both.","source_cn":"第二个传说是，月神遗殿隐藏着两个泉眼。如果能打开两处泉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x949EF584E9532AF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1029501017:0":{"text":"I've already confirmed the spring's location, but I haven't a clue how to activate it or what Nakalig's treasure actually is.","source_cn":"泉眼的位置我已经确定了，但是具体如何开启以及月神的宝藏...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3287C12F8A2369D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1029501018:0":{"text":"I'm not overly interested in the treasure itself, but I'm dying to see what the treasure of a Celestial could be. Please, I beg you!","source_cn":"我对宝藏本身并不感兴趣，只想窥得何为神的宝藏。拜托你们了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B7BED4445A5467F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:21:0:1":{"text":"Very.","source_cn":"很有兴趣","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8A5D24E75A344C58","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Very.","female":"Very.","variant_male_record_index":"62288","variant_female_record_index":"62289","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:21:1:2":{"text":"I need more details.","source_cn":"说来听听","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6F84B74F7D4059D0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I need more details.","female":"I need more details.","variant_male_record_index":"62290","variant_female_record_index":"62291","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"Fay did a good job this time.","source_cn":"菲这次做得很好","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xADC10285CF3C6629","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Fay did a good job this time.","female":"Fay did a good job this time.","variant_male_record_index":"62284","variant_female_record_index":"62285","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:1:2":{"text":"Fay didn't make any trouble.","source_cn":"菲没有闯祸","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB148984565E8A5AA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Fay didn't make any trouble.","female":"Fay didn't make any trouble.","variant_male_record_index":"62286","variant_female_record_index":"62287","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:冬青学者阿莉雅":{"text":"Scholar Alya","source":"冬青学者阿莉雅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:菲":{"text":"Fay","source":"菲","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卢修斯":{"text":"Lucius","source":"卢修斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:特弥希娅":{"text":"Temesia","source":"特弥希娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":25,"localized_text_count":24,"speaker_count":4}}